Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:25.22,Ripple,,0,0,0,,公主協奏輝光共詠！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:25.22,Meteor,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Princession Aura Ensemble！
